sentences.l:
but to my mother to tell
the attendant housekeeper to send out as quickly as possible,
secretly;

and not Athena
did he escape, going from the steading, Eumaeus the swineherd,
but she came near;

and heavenly Odysseus understood,
and out of the hall he went, past the great wall of the yard,
and stood before her;

Now at last to your son speak the word, and do not hide it,
so that, death and death-fate for the suitors having fitted together,
the two of you may go to the very famous town;

for no other any more will come here, Odysseus,
but here I am, such as I am, having suffered evils, and much having wandered,
I have come in the twentieth year to my fatherland.
